# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Pecia .gitignore
# Repo root = the main/ source folder. Everything tracked here must be pure
# source + docs + build scripts. Only build-run artifacts that a test/step
# leaves inside main/ are ignored.
#
# IMPORTANT: main/script/scripts/**/folder.ini files ARE source (default
# script folder-name translations) and MUST stay tracked - so *.ini is NOT
# blanket-ignored.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# CTest artifacts generated under main/build/ (the build scripts themselves
# are source; only what CTest outputs is disposable). ctest normally runs from
# <root>/temp/cmake_build (see build/_common.bat BUILD_DIR), so this is a
# safety net for anyone who runs ctest inside main/build/ by hand.
build/Testing/

# Generic run-time debris in case anything is generated inside main/.
*.log
*.dmp
*.obj
*.exe
*.dll
*.lib
*.exp
*.pdb
*.map
*.o
*.a

# Developer-local tooling.
.vscode/
.idea/

# NOTE: .thirdparty/ , build_cmake/ , build/ (exe out), rust_build/ , temp/ ,
# release/ live OUTSIDE main/ (project-root working artifacts), so they are
# not represented here.

# Generated performance-test fixtures under example/ (produced on demand by the
# scripts in example/ex2.LargeFile/ and example/ex3.LargeMarkdown/). These are
# multi-hundred-MB / GB files and must NOT be committed. The generator scripts
# stay tracked (usage is documented in docs/STRESS_TEST_PLAN.md).
example/ex2.LargeFile/*mb.txt
example/ex3.LargeMarkdown/*kb.md
example/ex3.LargeMarkdown/*mb.md
